\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">गद्य, पद्य (स्पर्श) एवं संचयन</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">28</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#FFFFFF; border-bottom:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">घ</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">रचनात्मक लेखन</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">अनुच्छेद, पत्र, सूचना, विज्ञापन, ई-मेल</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">22</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#F8FAFC; border-bottom:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">कुल</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">वार्षिक बोर्ड परीक्षा</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\"></td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">80</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#FFFFFF; border-bottom:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\"></td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">आंतरिक मूल्यांकन</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">परियोजना एवं मौखिक</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">20</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#F8FAFC; border-bottom:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">कुल</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\"></td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\"></td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">100</td>\n</tr>\n</table></div>\n\n                    <div style=\"background: #EBF3FD; border-left: 5px solid #156082; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.85rem 1.15rem; margin: 1.4rem 0 0.85rem;\">\n                      <h3 style=\"margin: 0; color: #156082; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800;\">खंड–क: अपठित बोध – 2 गद्यांश, दोनों अनिवार्य</h3>\n                    </div>\n                    \n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto; margin:1rem 0 1.5rem;\"><table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; border:1px solid #BAE6FD; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(15,23,42,0.04);\">\n<tr style=\"background:#156082; border-bottom:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">\n<th style=\"padding:12px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; font-weight:700; color:#FFFFFF; border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); text-align:left;\">प्रश्न</th>\n<th style=\"padding:12px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; font-weight:700; color:#FFFFFF; border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); text-align:left;\">विवरण</th>\n<th style=\"padding:12px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; font-weight:700; color:#FFFFFF; border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); text-align:left;\">अंक</th>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#F8FAFC; border-bottom:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">3 बहुविकल्पीय प्रश्न (1अंक  )2 लघुरात्मक प्रश्न  (2 अंक  )कुल - 5 प्रश्न</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">लगभग 200 शब्दों का अपठित गद्यांश</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;\">7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"ba